 {"id": "S14", "text": "Isole les zones du PLU dont le libellé est « Zone à urbaniser » et fais-en une zone tampon de 50 mètres.", "expected": [{"command": "layer.select_by_attribute", "params": {"layer": "plu_zonage_a81d5c06_2e9f_4a37_b6c4_5f13e07d92a8", "filter": {"field": "libelle", "operator": "eq", "value": "Zone à urbaniser"}}}, {"command": "analysis.buffer", "params": {"layer": "step:1", "distance": {"value": 50, "unit": "m"}}}], "expect_refusal": false},
